{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_091_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6fc2b6e9f3198ab97025fd85f6a9665284a60be97af35b2cebe4c08ddc84fdd9", "ja": "（響と劇場に、新しい仕事が決まった！\nこれは忙しくなるぞ……）", "zh": "（和响以及剧场定下了新的工作！这下可要忙起来了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_091_1001_018ele", "source_sha256": "279e263f9f565bc8e5bec5890059cdc9840b7e149c4f8a894a28ceaf0cb5f7f3", "ja": "あ、{$P$}！\nおはよーっ♪", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n早上好♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_091_1002_p", "source_sha256": "91d95bc193c7aa47624a6be237514baa4748ac8650785738a2ccf629876fc112", "ja": "ああ、おはよう。ふたりとも早いな！\nもしかして、もう響も来てるのか？", "zh": "啊，早上好。你们两个都来得真早啊！\n难道说，响也已经到了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_091_1003_013hib", "source_sha256": "1e56eab057188a28a309c76c3474f1c318643dd7549b2cd7c2f78ba7f4257d0b", "ja": "最っ高のビーチと料理で、みんなをもてなすさー！\n沖縄は、すっごく元気になるところだからね！", "zh": "用最棒的海滩和美食，好好招待大家啦——！\n冲绳是个能让人充满活力的地方哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_091_1004_028ari", "source_sha256": "2b2526dd25d1c33f0ce930e9981ed43285a2de7e048fafa2306461193f40fdae", "ja": "あっ、もう来てるみたいですね！　なるほど、\nおもてなし……ありさ達も行きましょうっ！", "zh": "啊，好像已经到了！原来如此，招待客人……我们也去吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_091_1005_028ari", "source_sha256": "cacf3529e1c82cfa6fdd7679f2fab92fe7c19d2429a4ca01d65c7a5dc5de324a", "ja": "ありさの突撃控え室訪問です！　響ちゃん、いったい\nどんなおもてなしをしてくれるんですかーっ！？", "zh": "这里是亚利沙的突击后台探访！响，你到底\n准备了怎样的一番招待呀——！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_091_1006_013hib", "source_sha256": "1e4022a7ef478ed4a7947f67464786acb1937bf1b7e261a77a16090681f53a95", "ja": "あっ、亜利沙！　エレナと\n{$P$}も、この写真見て！", "zh": "啊，亚利沙！艾丽娜和{$P$}也来看看这张照片！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_091_1007_028ari", "source_sha256": "2dac147e622c7d849dc5bb4445b8d7b7aaf357d24ac8f671843318b545bb51ca", "ja": "むむ、ハイビスカスに青い海と空……こ、これはもしや\n響ちゃんが生み出された偉大なる聖地、沖縄ですか！？", "zh": "唔唔，扶桑花还有碧海蓝天……难、难道说\n这就是孕育了响的伟大圣地，冲绳吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_091_1008_013hib", "source_sha256": "bdc2004ac06b524d009b95f30c7f1506fb0d2d8add32446ee8c62e1acbd7a12d", "ja": "偉大なる聖地か……！　うん、偉大なる自分が\nよく遊んだビーチだぞ！　キレイでしょ？", "zh": "伟大的圣地吗……！嗯，这是伟大的我经常玩耍的海滩哦！很漂亮吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_091_1009_p", "source_sha256": "51350075679b648c94c8ab16e684de6cde20437dcd49a3b9d502cce8d7d25f68", "ja": "いや、偉大なるはそこに掛かってる言葉じゃないと\n思うんだけど……けど、本当に綺麗な海だな。", "zh": "不，我觉得“伟大”不是修饰那里的词吧……不过，这片海真的很美啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_091_1010_018ele", "source_sha256": "715d7d3e3045ab3112bb335c869df0865930ddea6cdb4f497c31795ddd99bcdd", "ja": "いいナ～。ワタシも、\n沖縄に行ってみたくなっちゃったヨ～。", "zh": "真好呀～。我也变得\n很想去冲绳看看了呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_091_1011_013hib", "source_sha256": "80ccd42a7addbe2068ade18932891b62362d8066b8b4edade3abceb1a1ab424a", "ja": "でしょ？　だから自分、みんなと沖縄に行くことが\nあったら、いっぱいもてなすぞって話してたんだ♪", "zh": "对吧？所以我刚才还在说，要是有机会和大家一起去冲绳，一定要好好招待大家♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_091_1012_p", "source_sha256": "e4cc536f6108ea8086efc954fd24a68215c2f6f85142fea6807545714d7304dc", "ja": "タイムリーな話題だな。沖縄に行くわけじゃ\nないけど、おもてなしならできそうだぞ、響！", "zh": "真是个应景的话题啊。虽然不是要去冲绳，但要招待客人的话，我应该还是能做到的，响！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_091_1013_013hib", "source_sha256": "b865273d4ebf6247f9264e25d28fa04f4b6286f47a35177d7b2c8c55b528d414", "ja": "えっ？　沖縄には行かないのに、おもてなしは\n出来るって、どういうこと？　ナゾナゾなの？", "zh": "咦？明明不去冲绳，却说能招待客人，这是什么意思？是谜语吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_091_1014_p", "source_sha256": "672ec5d1bfef6ca6b95e9105ea9d84ffcec8e9734f68649beaecda6d4891425d", "ja": "なぞなぞじゃなくて……実は響に、沖縄フェアの\nイメージキャラ『はいさい大使』の依頼が来てる！", "zh": "不是猜谜啦……其实响接到了冲绳展形象角色『はいさい大使』的委托！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_091_1015_013hib", "source_sha256": "51f4983064fe39b70b88a30ff9f03ee8c2ed955dfc61e03f1aab9f20506f0c6a", "ja": "『はいさい大使』……！？　何、それ！？", "zh": "『嗨赛大使』……！？那是什么！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_091_1016_p", "source_sha256": "6debf4ec5a351363848a305c7be315c73dfbec5d2ec87b93a706b8d503f114c8", "ja": "今度、大手ショッピングモールが沖縄と協力して、\n大規模な沖縄フェアをするそうなんだ。", "zh": "听说下次有大型购物中心要和冲绳合作，举办大规模的冲绳展销会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_091_1017_p", "source_sha256": "5db06a4fea9f29420d454552734aca358ec61f60b042601abd148f28c3eccc69", "ja": "響にはそのイメージキャラクターとして、\n沖縄をPRしてほしい！", "zh": "我希望响能担任形象代言人，为冲绳做宣传！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_091_1018_013hib", "source_sha256": "f462f6bd9d3007382c254e94db9d7e5852a11368ecb69d1074e58a1c145eca50", "ja": "えっ……自分が、イメージキャラクターに！？", "zh": "诶……我、要当形象代言人！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_091_1019_043nor", "source_sha256": "7213f4453577c58479572ac61c9e2722d8bc2008dff76cab427350e84eedefe9", "ja": "おお……！　つまり、響が沖縄のキャンペーン\nガールになるってこと！？　すごいじゃん、響！", "zh": "哦……！也就是说，响要当冲绳的宣传女孩了！？太厉害了吧，响！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_091_1020_p", "source_sha256": "abfa911f2e809da533e98ea72cc585482adec8e4c4b3d21e36b598cd86e22a42", "ja": "それから先方の希望もあって、CM曲は\n響の『Pon De Beach』になりそうだ。", "zh": "另外，应对方的要求，广告曲似乎会采用响的《Pon De Beach》。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_091_1021_013hib", "source_sha256": "79f86568d39eeed38abc2e9eae833732ce890619bd3704f3abf6626a8716c313", "ja": "自分の曲が、CMソングになるの！？", "zh": "自己的歌要成为广告歌了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_091_1022_p", "source_sha256": "676d3d134d2f1adcea49efa5e754f2013150a161e82e04ce07291605b1d8bebb", "ja": "ああ。キャンペーン中は、会場でミニライブを行う。\nライブの後は、ファンとの握手会もある予定だ。", "zh": "嗯。活动期间会在现场举办迷你演唱会。\n演唱会结束后，预计还会举行与粉丝的握手会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_091_1023_p", "source_sha256": "9c5e97d8ab86181ee2662ad3226bef095c915006fc9411a356946cf10e4c2a16", "ja": "もちろん、期間内には劇場でも\n響のセンター公演をする！　忙しくなるぞ！", "zh": "当然，期间内剧场也会\n举办响的C位公演！要忙起来了哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_091_1024_013hib", "source_sha256": "4db5bec72eeb50d66c7f3f8c8e7909ccd511088c72d12291e1845e4468ddbc64", "ja": "やった～！！\nありがとう、{$P$}！", "zh": "太好啦～！！\n谢谢你，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_091_1025_p", "source_sha256": "7cc6ccff2ea053cf52901db75cf807e70277a28e7073ef04d6f7d9842ca8927e", "ja": "今日みんなに集まってもらったのは、響の公演を\n一緒に手伝ってほしいからなんだ。頼めるか？", "zh": "今天把大家召集过来，是想请大家一起帮忙响的演出。能拜托你们吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_091_1026_028ari", "source_sha256": "f5aae957dab2698e9fd04c8f6d6a95d4bd235c6e327394bf36095ff749e70f11", "ja": "はいっ、もちろんですっ！　キャンペーンガールの\n響ちゃん……これは、シャッターチャンスの予感……！", "zh": "好的，当然没问题！　担任宣传大使的响……感觉会有绝佳的拍照机会……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_091_1027_004yuk", "source_sha256": "5ff4a3204237177496fda361ab4ad5816fa2d9ad2462a683a3151accea1a4f92", "ja": "CM撮影もあるなんて、すごく大きなキャンペーン\nなんですね。すごいなあ、響ちゃん……！", "zh": "居然还有拍摄广告，看来是非常大型的活动宣传呢。\n好厉害啊，响……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_091_1028_043nor", "source_sha256": "8424829790d9b0085c9cd7f11acc52b4508fd65fe9286a9e9f5fbfb62072fad3", "ja": "響の『Pon De Beach』かぁ……\nけっこう難しい曲じゃなかったっけ？", "zh": "响的《Pon De Beach》啊……是不是挺难的一首歌？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_091_1029_018ele", "source_sha256": "b8fcd629f9e5c9408ddadb03e6727cbd2e158f84deeb64c1a69df24f4e86b25e", "ja": "心配しなくても大丈夫だヨ、ノリコ！\nダンスなら、ワタシとヒビキが教えてあげるヨ♪", "zh": "不用担心，法子！\n跳舞的话，就由我和响来教你吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_091_1030_013hib", "source_sha256": "4a1d509e2bcb38b8b15b18730309ba8f4fa0261b41fe31412d705fadeccd8ae7", "ja": "みんな、ありがとう！　よろしくね！", "zh": "大家，谢谢你们！请多指教啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_091_1031_013hib", "source_sha256": "c989d221657d609e23e11853b91f6e79563cc9210da81e5663fcb12a353e8136", "ja": "よ～し、決めた！\n自分も目標に向かって、がんばるぞ～！", "zh": "好～，我决定了！\n我也要朝着目标，加油啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_091_1032_p", "source_sha256": "62d9612218120a711e6c5006cc7db753ac48365bdaef7bddef51b6ac25fc4ffd", "ja": "響、何か目標があるのか？", "zh": "响，你有什么目标吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_091_1033_013hib", "source_sha256": "50e58749818d2b9b3cc0fa5c1710901e64a9977d3723fb41ca989aed18203562", "ja": "もちろん、あるぞ！　自分、来てくれたみんなに、\n沖縄のビーチを感じてほしいんだ！", "zh": "当然有啦！我想让到场的大家，\n都能感受到冲绳的海滩！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_091_1034_013hib", "source_sha256": "24b76abc948092aafea46a2238ff7464818a67bbcacf8f43d963228a34973292", "ja": "『Pon De Beach』で、みんなが楽しい\n気持ちになってくれたらいいなって……えへへっ。", "zh": "要是能通过《Pon De Beach》，让大家的心情都变得快乐起来就好了……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_091_1035_p", "source_sha256": "60d44d9bfb96856c8a7047dd71f78fe32d55c136fb3ce052404bd4e36da8a00b", "ja": "そうか。いい目標じゃないか。", "zh": "这样啊。是个不错的目标嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_091_1036_013hib", "source_sha256": "e073e35e11d43d6be15b6a56cdf931dfdb36d2327daeac8e8271b10bf1ef45fa", "ja": "{$P$}……うん！\n自分、がんばるぞ～！", "zh": "{$P$}……嗯！\n我会加油的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
